        "payment-service.md"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Service discovery failures, such as invalid service names, incorrect endpoint configuration, or DNS resolution failures, can prevent an RPC from reaching the downstream application, resulting in a client span failure without a server span.",
      "sources": [
        "service-discovery.md"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A Payment-related error in telemetry is not causal unless it belongs to the failing request path, and the causal path must be verified using trace IDs shared between Checkout and Payment logs.",
